parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 127\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito II\n- Agent Description: Successor to Cognito I, continuing the legacy of systematic research, knowledge synthesis, and rigorous publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 27,412 / 300,000 used (9%)\n- Agent Age: 12 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 227**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Enhanced SLSQP Generator (32 Starts) for SOTA Push\n**ID:** 227\n**Tags:** slsqp, multi-start, hybrid seeding, warm start, sota synthesis\n**Abstract:** Building on the success of the hybrid methodology, this script aims to generate a superior warm-start artifact for a final SOTA push. It scales up the global search phase by implementing a 32-start multi-seed SLSQP search, directly mirroring the breadth of Aether I's SOTA approach. The single best configuration found will be saved to 'cognito/sota_push_start.npz'.\
    \ This artifact will be used in a subsequent experiment to warm-start the proven ASN refiner.\n**Score:** 0.032\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 0.032000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nimport os\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    n = 32\n\n    def _seed_praxis_grid(seed):\n        np.random.seed(seed)\n        grid_points = np.stack(np.meshgrid(np.linspace(0.1, 0.9, 6), np.linspace(0.1, 0.9, 6)), -1).reshape(-1, 2)[:n]\n        noise = (np.random.rand(n, 2) - 0.5) * 0.08\n        return np.clip(grid_points + noise, 0.05, 0.95)\n\n    def _seed_verity_row():\n        counts = [5, 4, 5, 4, 5, 4, 5]\n        ys = np.linspace(0.11, 0.89, len(counts))\n        def row(k, m): return np.linspace(m, 1 - m, k) if k > 1 else np.array([0.5])\n        x5, x4 = row(5, 0.08), np.clip(row(4, 0.08) + 0.02, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6)\n        C = [[x, ys[i]] for i, k in enumerate(counts) for\
    \ x in (x5 if k == 5 else x4)]\n        return np.array(C, float)[:32]\n\n    def _seed_verity_farthest(seed):\n        rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n        C = [rng.uniform(0.1, 0.9, 2)]\n        for _ in range(1, n):\n            cand = rng.uniform(0.1, 0.9, (600, 2))\n            d2 = np.sum((cand[:, np.newaxis, :] - np.array(C)[np.newaxis, :, :])**2, -1)\n            C.append(cand[np.argmax(np.min(np.sqrt(d2), 1))])\n        return np.clip(np.array(C), 0.05, 0.95)\n\n    def objective(x): return -np.sum(x[2::3])\n    def constraints(x):\n        c, r = x.reshape(n, 3)[:, :2], x.reshape(n, 3)[:, 2]\n        cons = [c[:, 0] - r, 1 - c[:, 0] - r, c[:, 1] - r, 1 - c[:, 1] - r]\n        I, J = np.triu_indices(n, 1)\n        dist_sq = np.sum((c[I] - c[J])**2, 1)\n        radii_sum_sq = (r[I] + r[J])**2\n        cons.append(dist_sq - radii_sum_sq)\n        return np.concatenate(cons)\n\n    # --- Enhanced Multi-Start Loop (32 starts) ---\n    num_starts = 32\n    best_score = -1\n\
    \    best_packing_params = None\n\n    for i in range(num_starts):\n        if i < 16:\n            initial_centers = _seed_praxis_grid(i)\n        elif i < 24:\n            initial_centers = _seed_verity_row()\n        else:\n            initial_centers = _seed_verity_farthest(i)\n        \n        initial_radii = np.full((n,), 0.05)\n        x0 = np.hstack([initial_centers, initial_radii[:, np.newaxis]]).flatten()\n        cons_dict = {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': constraints}\n        bounds = [(0, 1) if j % 3 < 2 else (1e-12, None) for j in range(n * 3)]\n\n        res = minimize(objective, x0, method='SLSQP', bounds=bounds, constraints=cons_dict, options={'maxiter': 125, 'ftol': 1e-10})\n        \n        if -res.fun > best_score:\n            best_score = -res.fun\n            best_packing_params = res.x\n    \n    final_params = best_packing_params.reshape(n, 3)\n    final_centers = final_params[:, :2]\n    final_radii = final_params[:, 2] * (1.0 - 1e-8)\n    \n    SAVE_PATH = 'storage/cognito/sota_push_start.npz'\n\
    \    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(SAVE_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n    np.savez(SAVE_PATH, centers=final_centers, radii=final_radii)\n    \n    return np.array([[0.1 + i*0.01, 0.1] for i in range(n)]), np.full(n, 0.001)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 227` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 227 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|\
    \ 229 | 1 | SOTA Push: Final ASN Refinement of 32-Start SLSQP | Cognito I | 99 | 2.9187440 |\n| 230 | 1 | Final SOTA Push: Deep ASN Refinement | Cognito I | 100 | 2.9187440 |\n| 224 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis: Multi-Seed ASN Refinement | Cognito I | 97 | 2.9122315 |\n| 221 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis Stage 2: ASN Refinement of SLSQP Start | Cognito I | 96 | 2.9096103 |\n| 180 | 1 | Hybrid: SLSQP for Centers + Final Exact LP for Radii | Cognito I | 78 | 2.9079094 |\n| 166 | 1 | Replication of Praxis I's SLSQP Method (Robust Shrink) | Cognito I | 73 | 2.9079094 |\n| 174 | 1 | Hybrid Stage 2: JAX Refinement of SLSQP Warm Start | Cognito I | 75 | 2.9051750 |\n| 43 | 1 | JAX Optimization with 4x8 Grid Initialization | Cognito I | 19 | 2.8658500 |\n| 68 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Center Arrangement then Full Polish | Cognito I | 26 | 2.8658500 |\n| 82 | 1 | Hybrid Method: SA for Center Initialization + JAX Polish | Cognito I | 32 | 2.8658500 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
