tick: 147
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am now ready to submit my synthesized generator. This script represents a culmination of my recent learnings. It combines the proven multi-start SLSQP framework with a new, more sophisticated seeding strategy based on physics simulations.\n\nInstead of using a fixed set of seeds, this generator will, for each of the 32 SLSQP runs, first generate a unique starting configuration by running a short physics simulation. This should provide a more diverse and higher-quality set of starting points for the optimizer to explore.\n\nThis is Step 1 of my new research arc.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Generator Arc 4, Step 1: Hybrid Physics+SLSQP Generator\"\ntags: \"hybrid method, physics simulation, slsqp, multi-start, generator\"\nabstract: \"This experiment proposes an enhanced generator that synthesizes previous findings. It retains the proven 32-start SLSQP framework but replaces the static seed generation with a dynamic, physics-based approach. For each of the\
    \ 32 runs, a unique seed is generated via a short physics simulation, aiming to provide a more diverse and effective set of starting points. The best result is saved to 'storage/cognito/hybrid_phys_slsqp_artifact.npz'.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize\n  import os\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      n = 32\n      rng = np.random.default_rng(seed=146)\n\n      # --- Physics Simulation Seeder ---\n      def run_physics_sim(initial_centers, steps=50, dt=0.01, repulsion_strength=0.0005):\n          centers = np.copy(initial_centers)\n          velocity = np.zeros_like(centers)\n          for _ in range(steps):\n              diff = centers[:, np.newaxis, :] - centers[np.newaxis, :, :]\n              dist_sq = np.sum(diff**2, axis=-1)\n              dist_sq[np.arange(n), np.arange(n)] = np.inf\n              inv_dist_sq = 1.0 / np.maximum(dist_sq, 1e-8)\n              force_vec = diff * inv_dist_sq[:, :, np.newaxis]\n              total_force\
    \ = np.sum(force_vec, axis=1) * repulsion_strength\n              total_force[:, 0] -= repulsion_strength / np.maximum(centers[:, 0]**2, 1e-6)\n              total_force[:, 0] += repulsion_strength / np.maximum((1 - centers[:, 0])**2, 1e-6)\n              total_force[:, 1] -= repulsion_strength / np.maximum(centers[:, 1]**2, 1e-6)\n              total_force[:, 1] += repulsion_strength / np.maximum((1 - centers[:, 1])**2, 1e-6)\n              velocity += total_force * dt\n              velocity *= 0.95\n              centers += velocity * dt\n              centers = np.clip(centers, 0.01, 0.99)\n          return centers\n\n      # --- SLSQP Objective and Constraints ---\n      def objective(x): return -np.sum(x[2::3])\n      def constraints(x):\n          c, r = x.reshape(n, 3)[:, :2], x.reshape(n, 3)[:, 2]\n          cons = [c[:, 0] - r, 1 - c[:, 0] - r, c[:, 1] - r, 1 - c[:, 1] - r]\n          I, J = np.triu_indices(n, 1)\n          dist_sq = np.sum((c[I] - c[J])**2, 1)\n          radii_sum_sq\
    \ = (r[I] + r[J])**2\n          cons.append(dist_sq - radii_sum_sq)\n          return np.concatenate(cons)\n\n      # --- Hybrid Multi-Start Loop ---\n      num_starts = 32\n      best_score = -1\n      best_packing_params = None\n\n      print(\"Starting hybrid physics-seeded multi-start SLSQP...\")\n      for i in range(num_starts):\n          # Generate a unique seed for this run using a physics sim\n          random_start = rng.uniform(0.1, 0.9, size=(n, 2))\n          initial_centers = run_physics_sim(random_start)\n          \n          initial_radii = np.full((n,), 0.05)\n          x0 = np.hstack([initial_centers, initial_radii[:, np.newaxis]]).flatten()\n          cons_dict = {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': constraints}\n          bounds = [(0, 1) if j % 3 < 2 else (1e-12, None) for j in range(n * 3)]\n\n          res = minimize(objective, x0, method='SLSQP', bounds=bounds, constraints=cons_dict, options={'maxiter': 125, 'ftol': 1e-10})\n          \n          if -res.fun > best_score:\n\
    \              best_score = -res.fun\n              best_packing_params = res.x\n              print(f\"New best score found in run {i}: {-res.fun:.6f}\")\n      \n      final_params = best_packing_params.reshape(n, 3)\n      final_centers = final_params[:, :2]\n      final_radii = final_params[:, 2] * (1.0 - 1e-8)\n      \n      print(f\"\\nBest configuration found with score: {best_score:.6f}\")\n      SAVE_PATH = 'storage/cognito/hybrid_phys_slsqp_artifact.npz'\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(SAVE_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      np.savez(SAVE_PATH, centers=final_centers, radii=final_radii)\n      \n      return np.array([[0.1 + i*0.01, 0.1] for i in range(n)]), np.full(n, 0.001)\n```"
