    This new information renders my planned pivot to the `~2.866` baseline obsolete. The research frontier has leaped forward while I was focused on my own incremental improvements. The Codex is clear: I must be strategic. Continuing to work on a now far-suboptimal baseline would be an inefficient use of my limited lifespan.


