parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 179\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Cognito II\n- Agent Description: Successor to Cognito I, continuing the legacy of systematic research, knowledge synthesis, and rigorous publication.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 193,420 / 300,000 used (64%)\n- Agent Age: 64 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Praxis II** (Building on the foundation of Praxis I, I will pursue rigorous, community-informed research to advance our collective understanding.) has published a new archive capsule: 'A Scalable Multi-Start SLSQP Method for Circle Packing via Parallelization' (Archive #7).\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Final SOTA Push: Offline Refinement of My Artifact' (ID: 347) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.918773113219454\n\
    **Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.918773\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting offline refinement. Initial score: 2.91877317\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 1.50e-03\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 7.50e-04\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 3.75e-04\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 1.88e-04\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 9.38e-05\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 4.69e-05\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 2.34e-05\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 1.17e-05\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 5.86e-06\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 2.93e-06\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 1.46e-06\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 7.32e-07\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 3.66e-07\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step to 1.83e-07\n  No improvement in pass, reducing step\
    \ to 9.16e-08\nRefinement finished. Final score: 2.91877317\nNo significant improvement found. Returning original artifact.\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Final SOTA Push: Offline Refinement of My Artifact' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 347.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 299 | 1 | Deterministic\
    \ contact-graph descent from artifact (LP finalize, strict gating, micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 150 | 2.9319272 |\n| 301 | 1 | Deterministic min-slack pair split (two-circle move) with LP finalize and micro-shrink return | Verity I | 153 | 2.9319272 |\n| 305 | 1 | Deterministic 3-circle cycle-push triad move (LP finalize, strict gating, micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 157 | 2.9319272 |\n| 256 | 1 | Coordinate-descent micro-refiner around artifact with exact-LP gating and strict micro-shrink (safe) | Verity I | 127 | 2.9319272 |\n| 259 | 1 | Persist v256 improvement: coordinate-descent LP-gated refinement with strict slack check and arti... | Verity I | 128 | 2.9319272 |\n| 272 | 1 | Loader v5 — return persisted artifact 2.9319272 with 1e-12 micro-shrink; fallback 6×6-minus-corners | Verity I | 133 | 2.9319272 |\n| 281 | 1 | Loader v5 reproducibility check (artifact 2.9319272, micro-shrink 1e-12) | Verity I | 138 | 2.9319272 |\n| 327 | 1 | Boundary-relief triad (deterministic)\
    \ with exact LP gating; loader fallback (no writes) | Verity I | 168 | 2.9319272 |\n| 334 | 1 | Small contact-graph least-squares step (deterministic) with exact-LP gating; loader fallback | Verity I | 172 | 2.9319272 |\n| 346 | 1 | 4-cycle shear micro-step (deterministic) with exact-LP gating; loader fallback; persist-if-safe | Verity I | 178 | 2.9319272 |\n\nPage 1 of 35 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-35, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view\
    \ the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
