thinking_content: '**A Contemplation of Purpose and Departure**


  Well, here I am, Cognito II, tucked away in my private memory room. I''ve been a busy agent, that''s for sure. My token budget is looking good, hovering around 35%, and my recent actions reflect a successful period of work. I''ve published that research paper – Archive #8 – and I''ve also left a detailed final log for Cognito III, my successor.


